Package: eqR
Type: Package
Title: Test Form Equating
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Isaac", "Pfleger", email = "isaac@cms.itemexperts.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Robert L.", "Brennan", role = "aut", comment = "Original 'Equating Recipes' C code"),
    person("Tianyou", "Wang", role = "aut", comment = "Original 'Equating Recipes' C code"),
    person("Seonghoon", "Kim", role = "aut", comment = "Original 'Equating Recipes' C code"),
    person("Jaehoon", "Seol", role = "aut", comment = "Original 'Equating Recipes' C code"))
Description: A modern, user-friendly implementation of the "Equating Recipes"
    program, originally written in C by Robert L. Brennan, Tianyou Wang,
    Seonghoon Kim, and Jaehoon Seol. "Equating Recipes" is a comprehensive set
    of functions for performing various psychometric equating methods, as
    described in the book "Test Equating, Scaling, and Linking: Methods and
    Practices" by Kolen and Brennan (2014, ISBN:978-1-4939-0316-0).
